    "title": {
      "en": "Mythic Sszorak Quality of Life Change with Patch 12.1.5",
      "es": "Cambio mítico en la calidad de vida de Sszorak con el parche 12.1.5"
    },
    "summary": {
      "en": "Mythic Sszorak Quality of Life Change with Patch 12.1.5...",
      "es": "Cambio mítico en la calidad de vida de Sszorak con el parche 12.1.5..."
    },
    "contentHtml": "\n            <div id=\"news-post-6ace7ba78a73e2.87233680\" data-insert-ads=\"article\" data-zaf-dynamic=\"article\" data-units-dynamic=\"article\" data-zaf-slot=\"true\">Blizzard has announced a quality of life update for Mythic Sszorak which will make the encounter easier to complete. <br><br>The common strategy for Mythic Sszorak is to trigger the Mythic mechanic, <a href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/spell=1297414/to-the-slaughter\" class=\"icontiny\" data-entity=\"spell\" data-entity-has-icon=\"true\" data-contiguous=\"true\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_warrior_dragoncharge.gif\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"vertical-align: middle;\"> <span class=\"tinyicontxt\">To the Slaughter</span></a>, at very specific times. Players were forced to trigger this mechanic with less than a second left before the 2nd <a href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/spell=1305959/venomous-surge\" class=\"icontiny\" data-entity=\"spell\" data-entity-has-icon=\"true\" data-contiguous=\"true\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/ability_creature_poison_06.gif\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"vertical-align: middle;\"> <span class=\"tinyicontxt\">Venomous Surge</span></a> cast of each phase, and then trigger it again directly after the 1st Tank frontal of each phase or else the group instantly wiped. With these change, the trigger times are significantly less strict which will make it much more lenient for players on farm and progression.<div class=\"quote-box exclude-units last\" data-type=\"blizzard\" data-has-links=\"true\" data-has-source=\"true\" data-has-toggle=\"true\"><div class=\"quote-source\">Blizzard</div><div class=\"quote-header\"><a href=\"https://us.forums.blizzard.com/en/wow/t/2380514/31\" target=\"_blank\">View Original</a><a class=\"quote-toggle\" href=\"javascript:\" aria-label=\"Toggle quote visibility\"></a></div><div class=\"quote-body\" data-markup-content-target=\"1\">An additional Mythic raid tuning adjustment has been added for Sszorak in the Venomous Abyss.<ul class=\"last\"><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\"><b>The Venomous Abyss</b><ul class=\"last\"><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\"><b>Sszorak</b><ul class=\"last\"><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\">Increased the time for Sszorak to reach 100 rage by 5 seconds in Mythic difficulty.</div></li></ul></div></li></ul></div></li></ul></div></div></div>\n            \n            <noscript>Blizzard has announced a quality of life update for Mythic Sszorak which will make the encounter easier to complete. <br /><br />The common strategy for Mythic Sszorak is to trigger the Mythic mechanic, <a href=\"/spell=1297414/to-the-slaughter\">To the Slaughter</a>, at very specific times. Players were forced to trigger this mechanic with less than a second left before the 2nd <a href=\"/spell=1305959/venomous-surge\">Venomous Surge</a> cast of each phase, and then trigger it again directly after the 1st Tank frontal of each phase or else the group instantly wiped. With these change, the trigger times are significantly less strict which will make it much more lenient for players on farm and progression. <br /><br /><div class=\"quote-box\" data-type=\"blizzard\"><div class=\"quote-header\"></div><div class=\"quote-body\">An additional Mythic raid tuning adjustment has been added for Sszorak in the Venomous Abyss.<br /><br /><ul><li><b>The Venomous Abyss</b><br /><br /> <b>Sszorak</b><br /><br /> Increased the time for Sszorak to reach 100 rage by 5 seconds in Mythic difficulty.</li></ul><br /><br /></div></div></noscript>            \n        ",
