      "en": "World of Warcraft: Forever Original Soundtrack Now Available...",
      "es": "La banda sonora original de World of Warcraft: Forever ya está disponible..."
    },
    "contentHtml": "\n            <div id=\"news-post-6ace7bd417f3b7.03500953\" data-insert-ads=\"article\" data-zaf-dynamic=\"article\" data-units-dynamic=\"article\" data-zaf-slot=\"true\">The World of Warcraft: Forever Original soundtrack is now available across multiple streaming platforms! Listen to the soothing sounds of Zephras Isle, the Riverglades, Hyjal and more.<br><br>World of Warcraft: Forever launches on November 4th, 2026 and Blizzard has now released the original soundtrack of the upcoming game! This is available on YouTube, <a href=\"https://open.spotify.com/album/3Y0nJ9S6DFhavJDUYzeKgM\" data-contiguous=\"true\" target=\"_blank\">Spotify </a>and other <a href=\"https://lnk.to/WoWForever\" data-contiguous=\"true\" target=\"_blank\">streaming services</a>. <br><br><div class=\"wh-center\" style=\"text-align: -webkit-center;\"><div class=\"wh-youtube exclude-units lazy-load-background\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16 / 9; background: url(&quot;https://i.ytimg.com/vi/tK3tWr9aXow/sddefault.jpg&quot;); max-width: 800px;\"><a aria-label=\"Play\" class=\"wh-youtube-inner\" href=\"javascript:\" style=\"padding-top: 45%;\"><i class=\"fa fa-play-circle\"></i></a></div></div></div>\n            \n            <noscript>The World of Warcraft: Forever Original soundtrack is now available across multiple streaming platforms! Listen to the soothing sounds of Zephras Isle, the Riverglades, Hyjal and more.<br /><br />World of Warcraft: Forever launches on November 4th, 2026 and Blizzard has now released the original soundtrack of the upcoming game! This is available on YouTube, <a href=\"https://open.spotify.com/album/3Y0nJ9S6DFhavJDUYzeKgM\" rel=\"nofollow\">Spotify </a>and other <a href=\"https://lnk.to/WoWForever\" rel=\"nofollow\">streaming services</a>. <br /><br /></noscript>            \n        ",
