    "title": {
      "en": "Subtlety Rogue Buff - Updates to 12.1.5 Patch Notes",
      "es": "Sutilmente Pícaro Mejora - Actualizaciones a 12.1.5 Notas del Parche"
    },
    "summary": {
      "en": "Subtlety Rogue Buff - Updates to 12.1.5 Patch Notes...",
      "es": "Sutilmente Pícaro Mejora - Actualiza a 12.1.5 Notas de parche..."
    },
    "contentHtml": "\n            <div id=\"news-post-6ace7c11b5f925.92619758\" data-insert-ads=\"article\" data-zaf-dynamic=\"article\" data-units-dynamic=\"article\" data-zaf-slot=\"true\">Blizzard has posted updates to the Patch 12.1.5 Patch Notes, which includes a buff to Subtlety Rogue!<br><br><div class=\"wh-center\" style=\"text-align: -webkit-center;\"><a class=\"wh-button zam-button\" href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/news/official-12-1-5-patch-notes-class-changes-labyrinths-kithix-raid-383206\" data-style=\"cta\" data-variation=\"undefined\"><span class=\"wh-button-text body-text zam-button-text\" data-text-style=\"body-small-bold\" data-markup-content-target=\"1\">Official Patch 12.1.5 Notes</span></a></div><div class=\"quote-box exclude-units last\" data-type=\"blizzard\" data-has-links=\"true\" data-has-source=\"true\" data-has-toggle=\"true\"><div class=\"quote-source\">Blizzard</div><div class=\"quote-header\"><a href=\"https://worldofwarcraft.blizzard.com/en-us/news/24304162\" target=\"_blank\">View Original</a><a class=\"quote-toggle\" href=\"javascript:\" aria-label=\"Toggle quote visibility\"></a></div><div class=\"quote-body\" data-markup-content-target=\"1\"><h2 id=\"classes\" class=\"heading-size-2 first\"><b>CLASSES</b></h2><ul class=\"exclude-units\"><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\"><b>ROGUE</b><ul class=\"last\"><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\">Subtlety<ul class=\"last\"><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\">All ability damage increased by 14%.<ul class=\"last\"><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\">​ <i>Developers’ notes: We’re increasing Subtlety’s ability damage to compensate for the changes to Subtlety's Shadow damage modifiers and any occurrences where those modifiers were previously applying their effects more than once.</i></div></li></ul></div></li></ul></div></li></ul></div></li></ul><h2 id=\"delves\" class=\"heading-size-2\">DELVES</h2><ul class=\"exclude-units\"><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\">Increased recipe drop rates in delve.</div></li></ul><h2 id=\"housing\" class=\"heading-size-2\">HOUSING</h2><ul class=\"last\"><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\">Reduced the cost of all crafted decor from pre-Midnight professions.</div></li></ul></div></div></div>\n            \n            <noscript>Blizzard has posted updates to the Patch 12.1.5 Patch Notes, which includes a buff to Subtlety Rogue!<br /><br />Official Patch 12.1.5 Notes<br /><br /><div class=\"quote-box\" data-type=\"blizzard\"><div class=\"quote-header\"></div><div class=\"quote-body\"><br /><h2 class=\"heading-size-2\"><b>CLASSES</b></h2><br /><ul><li><b>ROGUE</b><br /><br />Subtlety<br /> All ability damage increased by 14%. <br /><br /> ​ <i>Developers’ notes: We’re increasing Subtlety’s ability damage to compensate for the changes to Subtlety's Shadow damage modifiers and any occurrences where those modifiers were previously applying their effects more than once.</i> </li></ul><br /><br /><h2 class=\"heading-size-2\">DELVES</h2><br /><br /><ul><li>Increased recipe drop rates in delve.</li></ul><br /><br /><h2 class=\"heading-size-2\">HOUSING</h2><br /><br />Reduced the cost of all crafted decor from pre-Midnight professions.<br /><br /></div></div></noscript>            \n        ",
    "imageUrl": "https://wow.zamimg.com/uploads/blog/images/55723-subtlety-rogue-buff-updates-to-12-1-5-patch-notes.jpg",
