      "en": "Blizzard Confirms Venomous Abyss Hall of Fame Closing with Weekly Reset",
      "es": "Blizzard confirma el cierre del Salón de la Fama de Venomous Abyss con un reinicio semanal"
    },
    "summary": {
      "en": "Blizzard Confirms Venomous Abyss Hall of Fame Closing with Weekly Reset...",
      "es": "Blizzard confirma el cierre del Salón de la Fama de Venomous Abyss con un restablecimiento semanal..."
    },
    "contentHtml": "\n            <div id=\"news-post-6ace7c91f26bd9.78346766\" data-insert-ads=\"article\" data-zaf-dynamic=\"article\" data-units-dynamic=\"article\" data-zaf-slot=\"true\">Blizzard has confirmed that the Venomous Abyss Hall of Fame is closing with the Weekly Reset. <br><br>This is the last chance to obtain <a class=\"icontiny\" data-game=\"wow\" data-type=\"achievement\" data-entity=\"achievement\" href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/achievement=63652/hall-of-fame-ulatek\"><img alt=\"Hall of Fame: Ula'tek\" src=\"https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_121_raid_achievement_ulatek.gif\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"vertical-align: middle;\"> <span class=\"tinyicontxt\">Hall of Fame: Ula'tek</span></a> before it is no longer available in WoW!<div class=\"quote-box exclude-units last\" data-type=\"blizzard\" data-has-links=\"true\" data-has-source=\"true\" data-has-toggle=\"true\"><div class=\"quote-source\">Blizzard</div><div class=\"quote-header\"><a href=\"https://us.forums.blizzard.com/en/wow/t/2380548/1\" target=\"_blank\">View Original</a><a class=\"quote-toggle\" href=\"javascript:\" aria-label=\"Toggle quote visibility\"></a></div><div class=\"quote-body\" data-markup-content-target=\"1\">The <a href=\"https://worldofwarcraft.blizzard.com/en-us/worldsoul/us/leaderboards/hall-of-fame/mythic-raid/the-venomous-abyss\" data-contiguous=\"true\" target=\"_blank\">Hall of Fame</a> for The Venomous Abyss is now full, and we will close it for further entries with the next weekly reset (tomorrow in this region).<br><br>Congratulations to all who made it, and good luck to all of those who are pushing to complete The Venomous Abyss before weekly resets!</div></div></div>\n            \n            <noscript>Blizzard has confirmed that the Venomous Abyss Hall of Fame is closing with the Weekly Reset. <br /><br />This is the last chance to obtain <a href=\"/achievement=63652/hall-of-fame-ulatek\">Hall of Fame: Ula'tek</a> before it is no longer available in WoW!<br /><br /><div class=\"quote-box\" data-type=\"blizzard\"><div class=\"quote-header\"></div><div class=\"quote-body\">The <a href=\"https://worldofwarcraft.blizzard.com/en-us/worldsoul/us/leaderboards/hall-of-fame/mythic-raid/the-venomous-abyss\" rel=\"nofollow\">Hall of Fame</a> for The Venomous Abyss is now full, and we will close it for further entries with the next weekly reset (tomorrow in this region).<br /><br />Congratulations to all who made it, and good luck to all of those who are pushing to complete The Venomous Abyss before weekly resets!</div></div></noscript>            \n        ",
