  {
    "id": "wh-383389",
    "source": "wowhead",
    "dateRaw": "Mon, 12 Oct 2026 17:46:05 -0500",
    "author": "Wowhead Staff",
    "category": "Live",
    "badgeColor": "border-amber-500/60 bg-amber-950/80 text-amber-300",
    "title": {
      "en": "Massive Mythic Coiled Altar Nerfs with Weekly Reset",
      "es": "Nerfs de altar en espiral míticos masivos con reinicio semanal"
    },
    "summary": {
      "en": "Massive Mythic Coiled Altar Nerfs with Weekly Reset...",
      "es": "Nerfs de altar en espiral míticos masivos con restablecimiento semanal..."
    },
    "contentHtml": "\n            <div id=\"news-post-6ace7c63cbdc28.53024323\" data-insert-ads=\"article\" data-zaf-dynamic=\"article\" data-units-dynamic=\"article\" data-zaf-slot=\"true\">Blizzard has posted massive Mythic Coiled Altar nerfs for the weekly reset.<div class=\"quote-box exclude-units last\" data-type=\"blizzard\" data-has-links=\"true\" data-has-source=\"true\" data-has-toggle=\"true\"><div class=\"quote-source\">Blizzard</div><div class=\"quote-header\"><a href=\"https://us.forums.blizzard.com/en/wow/t/2380514/1\" target=\"_blank\">View Original</a><a class=\"quote-toggle\" href=\"javascript:\" aria-label=\"Toggle quote visibility\"></a></div><div class=\"quote-body\" data-markup-content-target=\"1\"><ul class=\"first last\"><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\"><b>The Venomous Abyss</b><ul class=\"last\"><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\"><b>The Coiled Altar</b><ul class=\"last\"><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\">The initial total number of orbs that spawn during Toxic Deluge in Phase 1 reduced to 8 on Mythic difficulty (was 10).</div></li><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\">The number of Virulent Mutations that spawn in Phase 1 reduced to 4 on Mythic difficulty (was 5).</div></li><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\">Virulent Mutation and Mutagenic Venom radius reduced to 6 yards (was 8 yards).</div></li><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\">The number of players Dreadmarch targets reduced to 3 on Mythic difficulty (was 4).</div></li><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\">Manifestations of Dread now immediately display their red glow visuals to their fixated target the moment they began fixating on all difficulties.</div></li><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\">Manifestations of Dread now despawn if their fixated target dies instead of re-fixating on a new player on all difficulties.</div></li><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\">Increased the angle Manifestations of Dread are detected and stunned by 10 degrees on all difficulties.</div></li><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\">Eternal Nightfall cast time increased by 2 seconds on all difficulties.</div></li></ul></div></li></ul></div></li></ul></div></div></div>\n            \n            <noscript>Blizzard has posted massive Mythic Coiled Altar nerfs for the weekly reset. <br /><br /><div class=\"quote-box\" data-type=\"blizzard\"><div class=\"quote-header\"></div><div class=\"quote-body\"><br /><ul><li><b>The Venomous Abyss</b><br /><br /> <b>The Coiled Altar</b><br /><br /> The initial total number of orbs that spawn during Toxic Deluge in Phase 1 reduced to 8 on Mythic difficulty (was 10).</li><li>The number of Virulent Mutations that spawn in Phase 1 reduced to 4 on Mythic difficulty (was 5).</li><li>Virulent Mutation and Mutagenic Venom radius reduced to 6 yards (was 8 yards).</li><li>The number of players Dreadmarch targets reduced to 3 on Mythic difficulty (was 4).</li><li>Manifestations of Dread now immediately display their red glow visuals to their fixated target the moment they began fixating on all difficulties.</li><li>Manifestations of Dread now despawn if their fixated target dies instead of re-fixating on a new player on all difficulties.</li><li>Increased the angle Manifestations of Dread are detected and stunned by 10 degrees on all difficulties.</li><li>Eternal Nightfall cast time increased by 2 seconds on all difficulties.</li></ul></div></div></noscript>            \n        ",
