    "contentHtml": "\n            <div id=\"news-post-6ace7ba7244076.93683357\" data-insert-ads=\"article\" data-zaf-dynamic=\"article\" data-units-dynamic=\"article\" data-zaf-slot=\"true\">Blizzard has posted Mythic+ dungeon tuning with the weekly reset, which includes Altar of Fangs nerfs!<div class=\"quote-box exclude-units last\" data-type=\"blizzard\" data-has-links=\"true\" data-has-source=\"true\" data-has-toggle=\"true\"><div class=\"quote-source\">Blizzard</div><div class=\"quote-header\"><a href=\"https://us.forums.blizzard.com/en/wow/t/2380514/1\" target=\"_blank\">View Original</a><a class=\"quote-toggle\" href=\"javascript:\" aria-label=\"Toggle quote visibility\"></a></div><div class=\"quote-body\" data-markup-content-target=\"1\">The following dungeon and raid tuning adjustments will go live with the 12.1.5 content update this week (tomorrow, October 13 in this region).<h2 id=\"dungeons-and-raid\" class=\"heading-size-2\">Dungeons and Raid</h2><ul class=\"last\"><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\"><b>Altar of Fangs</b><ul class=\"last\"><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\"><b>Primal Serpent</b><ul class=\"last\"><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\">Piercing Hiss damage reduced by 25%.</div></li><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\">Piercing Hiss cooldown increased by 10%.</div></li></ul></div></li><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\"><b>Ravenous Descendant</b><ul class=\"last\"><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\">Health reduced by 9%.</div></li></ul></div></li><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\"><b>Twinfang Harrower</b><ul class=\"last\"><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\">Health reduced by 6%.</div></li><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\">Paralyzing Shot periodic damage reduced by 20%.</div></li><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\">Paralyzing Shot duration reduced to 14 seconds (was 20 seconds).</div></li></ul></div></li><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\"><b>Ritual Chieftain</b><ul class=\"last\"><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\">Blood Sacrifice healing absorb reduced by 12%.</div></li></ul></div></li><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\"><b>Rattling Writhe</b><ul class=\"last\"><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\">Health reduced by 6%.</div></li><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\">Rattle periodic damage reduced by 25%.</div></li></ul></div></li><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\"><b>High Evolutionist</b><ul class=\"last\"><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\">Evolve now has a more prominent visual effect during channel.</div></li></ul></div></li><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\"><b>Bloodletter</b><ul class=\"last\"><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\">Health reduced by 5%.</div></li></ul></div></li><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\"><b>Ascendant Serpent</b><ul class=\"last\"><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\">Health reduced by 21%.</div></li></ul></div></li><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\"><b>Living Venom</b><ul class=\"last\"><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\">Health reduced by 25%.</div></li><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\">Venom Burst damage reduced by 50%.</div></li></ul></div></li><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\"><b>Rav’i</b><ul class=\"last\"><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\">Carrion Burst periodic damage reduced by 10%.</div></li></ul></div></li><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\"><b>Zul’jan</b><ul class=\"last\"><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\">Axegrinder periodic damage reduced by 15%.</div></li></ul></div></li></ul></div></li><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\"><b>Murder Row</b><ul class=\"last\"><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\"><b>Zaen Bladesorrow</b><ul class=\"last\"><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\">Fire Bomb damage reduced by 33%.</div></li></ul></div></li></ul></div></li><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\"><b>Ruby Life Pools</b><ul class=\"last\"><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\"><b>Earthbound Guardian</b><ul class=\"last\"><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\">Earthbound’s Imprint impact damage reduced by 21%.</div></li><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\">Earthbound’s Imprint periodic damage reduced by 13%.</div></li></ul></div></li><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\"><b>Defier Draghar</b><ul class=\"last\"><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\">Health reduced by 27%.</div></li></ul></div></li><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\"><b>Primalist Cinderweaver</b><ul class=\"last\"><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\">Living Bomb debuff can now be dispelled and the explosion damage will not occur when dispelled.</div></li></ul></div></li><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\"><b>Storm Warrior</b><ul class=\"last\"><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\">Thunderous Stomp damage reduced by 18%.</div></li></ul></div></li><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\"><b>High Channeler Ryvati</b><ul class=\"last\"><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\">Tempest Stormshield absorb percentage of maximum health reduced to 15% (was 20%).</div></li></ul></div></li><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\"><b>Melidrussa Chillworn</b><ul class=\"last\"><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\">Infused Whelp’s Cold Claws cooldown increased.</div></li></ul></div></li><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\"><b>Kokia Blazehoof</b><ul class=\"last\"><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\">Blazebound Firestorm health reduced by 12.5%.</div></li><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\">Blazebound Firestorm’s Inferno impact damage reduced by 18%.</div></li><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\">Blazebound Firestorm’s periodic damage reduced by 14%.</div></li></ul></div></li></ul></div></li><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\"><b>Temple of Sethraliss</b><ul class=\"last\"><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\"><b>Static Anomaly</b><ul class=\"last\"><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\">Spark Step damage reduced by 25%.</div></li></ul></div></li></ul></div></li><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\"><b>The Blinding Vale</b><ul class=\"last\"><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\"><b>Sporeblight Belcher</b><ul class=\"last\"><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\">Reduced health by 11%.</div></li><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\">Spouting Floret periodic damage reduced by 16%.</div></li><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\">Belch Sore damage reduced by 16%.</div></li><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\">Reduced the number of Belch Sore projectiles per tick to 3 (was 5).</div></li></ul></div></li><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\"><b>Radiant Spellsower</b><ul class=\"last\"><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\">Light Bolt Volley damage reduced by 16%.</div></li></ul></div></li><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\"><b>Lightwarden Ruia</b><ul class=\"last\"><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\">Lightfire periodic damage reduced by 15%.</div></li><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\">Pulverizing Strikes damage reduced by 12%.</div></li></ul></div></li><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\"><b>Ziekket</b><ul class=\"last\"><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\">Lightspawn Lasher health reduced by 10%.</div></li><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\">Lightspore Shot damage reduced by 16%.</div></li><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\">Oozing Xylem damage reduced by 16%.</div></li><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\">Vicious Regrowth haste and damage buff reduced to 20% (was 30%).</div></li></ul></div></li></ul></div></li><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\"><b>Voidscar Arena</b><ul class=\"last\"><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\"><b>Feral Saberon</b><ul class=\"last\"><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\">Savage Leap cooldown increased by 25%.</div></li></ul></div></li><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\"><b>Chitigoth</b><ul class=\"last\"><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\">Insidious Aura channel duration reduced to 8 seconds (was 10 seconds).</div></li></ul></div></li><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\"><b>Brutal Overseer</b><ul class=\"last\"><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\">Brutal Slams damage increase per slam reduced to 8% (was 10%).</div></li></ul></div></li><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\"><b>Atroxus</b><ul class=\"last\"><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\">Poison Splash periodic damage reduced by 11%.</div></li><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\">Toxic Aura periodic damage reduced by 20%.</div></li></ul></div></li><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\"><b>Charonus</b><ul class=\"last\"><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\">Condensed Mass periodic damage reduced by 20%.</div></li></ul></div></li></ul></div></li></ul></div></div></div>\n            \n            <noscript>Blizzard has posted Mythic+ dungeon tuning with the weekly reset, which includes Altar of Fangs nerfs!<br /><br /><div class=\"quote-box\" data-type=\"blizzard\"><div class=\"quote-header\"></div><div class=\"quote-body\">The following dungeon and raid tuning adjustments will go live with the 12.1.5 content update this week (tomorrow, October 13 in this region).<br /><br /><h2 class=\"heading-size-2\">Dungeons and Raid</h2><br /><ul><li><b>Altar of Fangs</b><br /><br /> <b>Primal Serpent</b><br /><br /> Piercing Hiss damage reduced by 25%.</li><li>Piercing Hiss cooldown increased by 10%.</li></ul><br /> <b>Ravenous Descendant</b><br /> <ul><li>Health reduced by 9%.</li></ul><br /> <b>Twinfang Harrower</b><br /> <ul><li>Health reduced by 6%.</li><li>Paralyzing Shot periodic damage reduced by 20%.</li><li>Paralyzing Shot duration reduced to 14 seconds (was 20 seconds).</li></ul><br /> <b>Ritual Chieftain</b><br /> <ul><li>Blood Sacrifice healing absorb reduced by 12%.</li></ul><br /> <b>Rattling Writhe</b><br /> <ul><li>Health reduced by 6%.</li><li>Rattle periodic damage reduced by 25%.</li></ul><br /> <b>High Evolutionist</b><br /> <ul><li>Evolve now has a more prominent visual effect during channel.</li></ul><br /> <b>Bloodletter</b><br /> <ul><li>Health reduced by 5%.</li></ul><br /> <b>Ascendant Serpent</b><br /> <ul><li>Health reduced by 21%.</li></ul><br /> <b>Living Venom</b><br /> <ul><li>Health reduced by 25%.</li><li>Venom Burst damage reduced by 50%.</li></ul><br /> <b>Rav’i</b><br /> <ul><li>Carrion Burst periodic damage reduced by 10%.</li></ul><br /> <b>Zul’jan</b><br /> <ul><li>Axegrinder periodic damage reduced by 15%.</li></ul><br /><br /> <b>Murder Row</b><br /> <ul><li><b>Zaen Bladesorrow</b><br /><br /> Fire Bomb damage reduced by 33%.</li></ul><br /><br /> <b>Ruby Life Pools</b><br /> <ul><li><b>Earthbound Guardian</b><br /><br /> Earthbound’s Imprint impact damage reduced by 21%.</li><li>Earthbound’s Imprint periodic damage reduced by 13%.</li></ul><br /> <b>Defier Draghar</b><br /> <ul><li>Health reduced by 27%.</li></ul><br /> <b>Primalist Cinderweaver</b><br /> <ul><li>Living Bomb debuff can now be dispelled and the explosion damage will not occur when dispelled.</li></ul><br /> <b>Storm Warrior</b><br /> <ul><li>Thunderous Stomp damage reduced by 18%.</li></ul><br /> <b>High Channeler Ryvati</b><br /> <ul><li>Tempest Stormshield absorb percentage of maximum health reduced to 15% (was 20%).</li></ul><br /> <b>Melidrussa Chillworn</b><br /> <ul><li>Infused Whelp’s Cold Claws cooldown increased.</li></ul><br /> <b>Kokia Blazehoof</b><br /> <ul><li>Blazebound Firestorm health reduced by 12.5%.</li><li>Blazebound Firestorm’s Inferno impact damage reduced by 18%.</li><li>Blazebound Firestorm’s periodic damage reduced by 14%.</li></ul><br /><br /> <b>Temple of Sethraliss</b><br /> <ul><li><b>Static Anomaly</b><br /><br /> Spark Step damage reduced by 25%.</li></ul><br /><br /> <b>The Blinding Vale</b><br /> <ul><li><b>Sporeblight Belcher</b><br /><br /> Reduced health by 11%.</li><li>Spouting Floret periodic damage reduced by 16%.</li><li>Belch Sore damage reduced by 16%.</li><li>Reduced the number of Belch Sore projectiles per tick to 3 (was 5).</li></ul><br /> <b>Radiant Spellsower</b><br /> <ul><li>Light Bolt Volley damage reduced by 16%.</li></ul><br /> <b>Lightwarden Ruia</b><br /> <ul><li>Lightfire periodic damage reduced by 15%.</li><li>Pulverizing Strikes damage reduced by 12%.</li></ul><br /> <b>Ziekket</b><br /> <ul><li>Lightspawn Lasher health reduced by 10%.</li><li>Lightspore Shot damage reduced by 16%.</li><li>Oozing Xylem damage reduced by 16%.</li><li>Vicious Regrowth haste and damage buff reduced to 20% (was 30%).</li></ul><br /><br /> <b>Voidscar Arena</b><br /> <ul><li><b>Feral Saberon</b><br /><br /> Savage Leap cooldown increased by 25%.</li></ul><br /> <b>Chitigoth</b><br /> <ul><li>Insidious Aura channel duration reduced to 8 seconds (was 10 seconds).</li></ul><br /> <b>Brutal Overseer</b><br /> <ul><li>Brutal Slams damage increase per slam reduced to 8% (was 10%).</li></ul><br /> <b>Atroxus</b><br /> <ul><li>Poison Splash periodic damage reduced by 11%.</li><li>Toxic Aura periodic damage reduced by 20%.</li></ul><br /> <b>Charonus</b><br /> <ul><li>Condensed Mass periodic damage reduced by 20%.</li></ul><br /><br /></div></div></noscript>            \n        ",
